<form class="search-form" action="/search"><div class="search-wrap"><span class="search-leading"><%- icon('search') %></span><input id="searchInput" name="q" value="<%= query %>" placeholder="検索" autocomplete="off" list="suggestions"><datalist id="suggestions"></datalist></div><button class="search-submit" aria-label="検索"><%- icon('search') %></button></form><div class="header-right"><button id="queueButton" class="icon-btn" aria-label="キュー"><%-icon("sub")%></button><button id="shortcutsButton" class="icon-btn" aria-label="キーボードショートカット">?</button><button id="themeButton" class="icon-btn" aria-label="テーマ"><span class="theme-dark"><%- icon('sun') %></span><span class="theme-light"><%- icon('moon') %></span></button><button id="accountButton" class="account-button" aria-label="YouTubeアカウント"><span id="accountAvatar" class="account-avatar"><%=authenticated?'✓':'W'%></span></button></div></header>
<aside class="sidebar" aria-label="メイン ナビゲーション"><nav class="sidebar-nav">
  <div class="sidebar-primary">
    <a class="nav-item sidebar-open-item compact-primary <%=page==='home'?'active':''%>" href="/"><%-icon('home')%><span>ホーム</span></a>
    <a class="nav-item sidebar-open-item compact-primary <%=page==='shorts'?'active':''%>" href="/shorts"><%-icon('shorts')%><span>ショート</span></a>
  </div>
  <hr class="sidebar-open-only">
  <section class="sidebar-section subscriptions-section">
    <a class="sidebar-section-title nav-item compact-primary <%=libraryType==='subscriptions'?'active':''%>" href="/subscriptions"><%-icon('sub')%><span>登録チャンネル</span><b class="sidebar-chevron">›</b></a>
    <div id="sidebarSubscriptions" class="sidebar-channel-list sidebar-open-only" aria-live="polite"><span class="sidebar-skeleton"></span><span class="sidebar-skeleton"></span><span class="sidebar-skeleton"></span></div>
  </section>
  <hr class="sidebar-open-only">
  <section class="sidebar-section mypage-section">
    <a class="sidebar-section-title nav-item compact-primary" href="/my-channel"><%-icon('history')%><span>あなた</span><b class="sidebar-chevron">›</b></a>
    <div class="sidebar-open-only sidebar-detail-list">
      <a class="nav-item" href="/my-channel"><span class="sidebar-detail-icon">●</span><span>チャンネル</span></a>
      <a class="nav-item <%=libraryType==='history'?'active':''%>" href="/history"><%-icon('history')%><span>履歴</span></a>
      <a class="nav-item" href="/playlists"><%-icon('sub')%><span>再生リスト</span></a>
      <a class="nav-item <%=libraryType==='watchLater'?'active':''%>" href="/watch-later"><%-icon('clock')%><span>後で見る</span></a>
      <a class="nav-item <%=libraryType==='likedVideos'?'active':''%>" href="/liked"><%-icon('like')%><span>高く評価した動画</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <footer class="sidebar-footer sidebar-open-only">© <%=new Date().getFullYear()%> WeTube</footer>
</nav></aside><div id="scrim" class="scrim"></div>
<main class="main <%=page==='watch'?'watch-main':''%>">
<% if(page==='home'||page==='search'){%><%if(page==='home'){%><div class="home-heading"><div><h2>おすすめ</h2><p class="home-subtitle">あなたへのおすすめ</p></div><button id="refreshRecommendations" class="refresh-pill">更新</button></div><nav class="home-chips" aria-label="おすすめカテゴリー"><a class="home-chip active" href="/">すべて</a><a class="home-chip" href="/feed/trending">急上昇</a><a class="home-chip" href="/feed/music">音楽</a><a class="home-chip" href="/feed/gaming">ゲーム</a><a class="home-chip" href="/feed/news">ニュース</a></nav><%}else{%><div class="chips"><%[['all','すべて'],['video','動画'],['channel','チャンネル'],['playlist','再生リスト']].forEach(([type,label])=>{%><a class="chip <%=searchType===type?'selected':''%>" href="/search?q=<%=encodeURIComponent(query)%>&type=<%=type%>"><%=label%></a><%})%></div><h1 class="results-title">「<%=query%>」の検索結果</h1><%}%><%if(page==='search'&&channels.length){%><section class="channel-results"><%channels.forEach(channel=>{%><article class="channel-result"><a href="/channel/<%=channel.id%>" class="channel-result-avatar-link"><%if(channel.thumbnail){%><img class="channel-result-avatar" src="<%=channel.thumbnail%>" alt=""><%}else{%><span class="channel-result-avatar fallback"><%=channel.name.slice(0,1)%></span><%}%></a><div class="channel-result-copy"><a class="channel-result-name" href="/channel/<%=channel.id%>"><%=channel.name%></a><span><%=[channel.handle,channel.subscribers,channel.videos].filter(Boolean).join('・')%></span><p><%=channel.description%></p></div><a class="channel-open" href="/channel/<%=channel.id%>">チャンネルを表示</a></article><%})%></section><%}%><section id="<%=page==='home'?'recommendationGrid':'searchResults'%>" class="<%=page==='search'?'search-results':'video-grid'%>"><%if(page==='home'&&!videos.length){%><%for(let i=0;i<8;i++){%><article class="video-card recommend-skeleton-card" aria-hidden="true"><div class="thumb skeleton-box"></div><div class="card-info"><span class="channel-avatar skeleton-circle"></span><div class="card-copy"><span class="skeleton-line skeleton-title"></span><span class="skeleton-line"></span><span class="skeleton-line skeleton-short"></span></div></div></article><%}%><%}else{%><%videos.forEach(v=>{%><article class="video-card <%=v.isShort?'short-card':''%>"><a class="thumb" href="<%=v.isShort?'/shorts#'+v.id:'/watch?v='+v.id%>"><img src="<%=v.thumbnail%>" alt="" loading="lazy"><%if(v.isShort){%><span class="short-badge"><%-icon('shorts')%>Shorts</span><%}else if(v.duration){%><span class="duration"><%=v.duration%></span><%}%></a><div class="card-info"><%if(v.authorThumbnail){%><img class="channel-avatar" src="<%=v.authorThumbnail%>" alt=""><%}else{%><span class="channel-avatar fallback"><%=v.author.slice(0,1)%></span><%}%><div class="card-copy"><a class="video-title" href="<%=v.isShort?'/shorts#'+v.id:'/watch?v='+v.id%>"><%=v.title%></a><span><%=v.author%></span><span><%= [v.views,v.published].filter(Boolean).join('・') %></span><%if(page==='search'&&v.description){%><p><%=v.description%></p><%}%></div><button class="more-btn"><%-icon('more')%></button></div></article><%})%><%}%></section><%if(page==='home'){%><%if(shorts&&shorts.length){%><section class="home-shorts-shelf"><div class="home-shelf-heading"><div><h2><%-icon('shorts')%> Shorts</h2><p>おすすめのショート動画</p></div><a href="/shorts">すべて見る</a></div><div class="home-shorts-row"><%shorts.forEach(v=>{%><article class="home-short-card"><a class="home-short-thumb" href="/shorts#<%=v.id%>"><img src="<%=v.thumbnail%>" alt="" loading="lazy"><span class="home-short-play"><%-icon('shorts')%></span></a><div class="home-short-copy"><a href="/shorts#<%=v.id%>"><%=v.title%></a><div class="home-short-channel"><%if(v.authorThumbnail){%><img src="<%=v.authorThumbnail%>" alt=""><%}else{%><span class="fallback"><%=String(v.author||'YouTube').slice(0,1)%></span><%}%><span><%=v.author||'YouTube'%></span></div><small><%=v.views||''%></small></div></article><%})%></div></section><%}%><%}else if(!videos.length&&!channels.length){%><div class="empty"><h2>検索結果が見つかりませんでした</h2></div><%}%><%}%>
<%if(page==='shorts'){%><section id="shortsFeed" class="shorts-feed" data-short-token="<%=typeof shortSession!=='undefined'?shortSession:''%>" data-channel-id="<%=typeof shortChannelId!=='undefined'?shortChannelId:''%>"><%videos.forEach((short,index)=>{%><article class="short-reel" data-short-id="<%=short.id%>" data-short-index="<%=index%>"><div class="short-shell"><iframe class="short-player" src="<%=index===0?short.eduUrl:''%>" data-src="<%=short.eduUrl%>" title="<%=short.title%>" allow="autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture; fullscreen" allowfullscreen></iframe><div class="short-scroll-capture" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="short-overlay"><a href="<%=short.authorId?'/channel/'+short.authorId:'#'%>" class="short-author"><%if(short.authorThumbnail){%><img src="<%=short.authorThumbnail%>" alt=""><%}else{%><span class="fallback"><%=short.author.slice(0,1)%></span><%}%><b><%=short.author%></b></a><p><%=short.title%></p></div></div><div class="short-actions"><button class="short-like" type="button"><%-icon('like')%><span>高評価</span></button><button class="short-comment" type="button"><%-icon('news')%><span>コメント</span></button><button class="short-share" type="button"><%-icon('share')%><span>共有</span></button><button class="short-save" type="button"><%-icon('clock')%><span>保存</span></button><button class="short-mute" type="button" aria-label="ミュート"><%-icon('music')%><span>音声</span></button><button class="short-clear" type="button" aria-label="表示を隠す"><%-icon('screen')%><span>画面をクリア</span></button><a href="/watch?v=<%=short.id%>"><%-icon('screen')%><span>通常表示</span></a></div></article><%})%></section><div class="short-pager"><button id="previousShort">↑</button><button id="nextShort">↓</button></div><aside id="shortComments" class="short-comments" aria-hidden="true"><header><h2>コメント</h2><button id="closeShortComments" type="button" aria-label="閉じる">×</button></header><div class="short-comment-tools"><button type="button" data-short-sort="top" class="active">人気順</button><button type="button" data-short-sort="new">新しい順</button></div><form id="shortCommentComposer" class="short-comment-composer"><textarea id="shortCommentText" maxlength="10000" placeholder="コメントを追加..."></textarea><button type="submit">投稿</button></form><div id="shortCommentsList"></div></aside><%}%><%if(page==='watch'&&video){%><div class="watch-layout"><section class="watch-primary"><div class="player-shell"><iframe id="player" src="<%=playerMode==='youtube'?youtubeUrl:eduUrl%>" title="<%=video.title%>" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe></div><h1 class="watch-title"><%=video.title%></h1><div class="watch-toolbar"><div class="channel-block"><%if(video.authorThumbnail){%><img class="watch-avatar" src="<%=video.authorThumbnail%>" alt=""><%}else{%><span class="watch-avatar fallback"><%=video.author.slice(0,1)%></span><%}%><div><%if(video.authorId){%><a href="/channel/<%=video.authorId%>" class="channel-name"><%=video.author%></a><%}else{%><b class="channel-name"><%=video.author%></b><%}%><small><%=video.views%></small></div><button id="subscribeButton" class="subscribe" data-channel-id="<%=video.authorId%>" data-channel-name="<%=video.author%>" data-channel-avatar="<%=video.authorThumbnail%>">登録</button></div><div class="actions"><button id="likeButton" class="pill"><%-icon('like')%><span>高評価</span></button><button id="saveButton" class="pill"><%-icon("clock")%><span>後で見る</span></button><button id="shareButton" class="pill"><%-icon('share')%><span>共有</span></button><button id="streamInfoButton" class="pill"><%-icon('screen')%><span>ストリーム情報</span></button><button id="playerButton" class="pill" data-mode="<%=playerMode%>" data-edu="<%=eduUrl%>" data-youtube="<%=youtubeUrl%>" data-edu-sources='<%- JSON.stringify(eduSources || []) %>' title="Edu再生方式を切り替え"><span><%=playerMode==='edu'?'Edu':'通常'%></span></button><button id="theaterButton" class="pill"><%-icon('screen')%></button></div></div><details class="description" open><summary><b><%= [video.views,video.published].filter(Boolean).join('　') %></b></summary><p><%=video.description||'説明はありません。'%></p></details><details id="transcriptPanel" class="panel"><summary>文字起こし</summary><div id="transcriptList" class="panel-body muted">開くと読み込みます</div></details><section class="comments"><h2>コメント</h2><details id="commentsPanel" class="panel"><summary>コメントを表示</summary><div class="sort-row"><button class="text-btn active" data-sort="top">人気順</button><button class="text-btn" data-sort="new">新しい順</button></div><form id="commentComposer" class="comment-composer"><textarea id="commentText" maxlength="10000" placeholder="コメントを追加..."></textarea><button type="submit">コメント</button></form><div id="commentsList" class="panel-body muted">読み込み待ち</div></details></section></section><aside class="related"><div class="related-chips"><span class="chip selected">すべて</span><label class="autoplay-switch"><input id="autoplayToggle" type="checkbox"><span>自動再生</span></label></div><%videos.forEach(v=>{%><a class="related-card" href="/watch?v=<%=v.id%>"><div class="related-thumb"><img src="<%=v.thumbnail%>" alt="" loading="lazy"><%if(v.duration){%><span class="duration"><%=v.duration%></span><%}%></div><div><b><%=v.title%></b><span><%=v.author%></span><span><%=v.views||'再生回数不明'%></span></div><%-icon('more','icon related-more')%></a><%})%></aside></div><%}%>
<%if(page==='channel'&&entity){%>
<section class="channel-page" data-channel-id="<%=entity.id%>">
  <div class="channel-banner<%=entity.banner?' has-image':''%>"><%if(entity.banner){%><img src="<%=entity.banner%>" alt="" loading="eager"><%}%></div>
  <div class="channel-header">
    <div class="channel-header-main">
      <%if(entity.image){%><img class="channel-avatar-xl" src="<%=entity.image%>" alt="<%=entity.title%>"><%}else{%><span class="channel-avatar-xl fallback"><%=entity.title.slice(0,1)%></span><%}%>
      <div class="channel-identity">
        <div class="channel-title-row"><h1><%=entity.title%></h1><%if(entity.verified){%><span class="channel-verified" title="認証済み">✓</span><%}%></div>
        <div class="channel-handle"><%=entity.handle||''%><%if(entity.subscribers){%>　<%=entity.subscribers%><%}%><%if(entity.videosCount){%>　<%=entity.videosCount%><%}%></div>
        <%if(entity.description){%><p class="channel-description"><%=entity.description%></p><%}%>
        <div class="channel-actions">
          <button id="channelSubscribeButton" class="channel-subscribe" data-channel-id="<%=entity.id%>">登録</button>
          <button class="channel-action" type="button" onclick="navigator.clipboard?.writeText(location.href)">共有</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <nav class="channel-tabs" aria-label="チャンネル">
    <%const channelTabs=[['home','ホーム',entity.tabs.home],['videos','動画',entity.tabs.videos],['shorts','ショート',entity.tabs.shorts],['live','ライブ',entity.tabs.live],['playlists','再生リスト',entity.tabs.playlists],['community','コミュニティ',entity.tabs.community],['about','概要',entity.tabs.about]];%>
    <%channelTabs.forEach(([key,label,enabled])=>{if(enabled){%><a class="<%=entity.tab===key?'active':''%>" href="/channel/<%=encodeURIComponent(entity.id)%>?tab=<%=key%>"><%=label%></a><%}})%>
    <form class="channel-search" action="/channel/<%=encodeURIComponent(entity.id)%>"><input type="hidden" name="tab" value="home"><input name="q" value="<%=entity.query||''%>" placeholder="チャンネル内を検索" aria-label="チャンネル内を検索"><button>⌕</button></form>
  </nav>
  <%if(entity.tab==='about'){%>
    <section class="channel-about">
      <div class="channel-about-main"><h2>概要</h2><p><%=entity.description||'このチャンネルには説明がありません。'%></p></div>
      <aside class="channel-about-side"><h2>チャンネルの詳細</h2><%if(entity.externalUrl){%><p><a href="<%=entity.externalUrl%>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">チャンネルURL</a></p><%}%><%if(entity.about?.views){%><p>総再生回数　<b><%=entity.about.views%></b></p><%}%><%if(entity.about?.joined){%><p>登録日　<b><%=entity.about.joined%></b></p><%}%><%if(entity.about?.country){%><p>所在地　<b><%=entity.about.country%></b></p><%}%></aside>
    </section>
  <%}else if(entity.tab==='home'&&channelContent.featured){%>
    <section class="channel-featured">
      <a class="channel-featured-thumb" href="/watch?v=<%=channelContent.featured.id%>"><img src="<%=channelContent.featured.thumbnail%>" alt="" loading="eager"><%if(channelContent.featured.duration){%><span><%=channelContent.featured.duration%></span><%}%></a>
      <div class="channel-featured-copy"><span class="channel-section-kicker">最新の動画</span><a href="/watch?v=<%=channelContent.featured.id%>"><h2><%=channelContent.featured.title%></h2></a><p><%=channelContent.featured.views||''%><%if(channelContent.featured.published){%> ・ <%=channelContent.featured.published%><%}%></p><p class="channel-featured-description"><%=channelContent.featured.description||''%></p></div>
    </section>
    <section class="channel-section"><div class="channel-section-head"><h2>動画</h2><a href="/channel/<%=encodeURIComponent(entity.id)%>?tab=videos">すべて見る</a></div><div class="video-grid channel-video-grid"><%channelContent.uploads.forEach(v=>{%><article class="video-card"><a class="thumb" href="/watch?v=<%=v.id%>"><img src="<%=v.thumbnail%>" alt="" loading="lazy"><%if(v.duration){%><span class="duration"><%=v.duration%></span><%}%></a><div class="card-info"><%if(entity.image){%><img class="channel-avatar" src="<%=entity.image%>" alt=""><%}else{%><span class="channel-avatar fallback"><%=entity.title.slice(0,1)%></span><%}%><div class="card-copy"><a class="video-title" href="/watch?v=<%=v.id%>"><%=v.title%></a><span><%=v.views||''%></span><span><%=v.published||''%></span></div><button class="more-btn"><%-icon('more')%></button></div></article><%})%></div></section>
    <%if(channelContent.shorts.length){%><section class="channel-section"><div class="channel-section-head"><h2>ショート</h2><a href="/channel/<%=encodeURIComponent(entity.id)%>?tab=shorts">すべて見る</a></div><div class="channel-shorts-row"><%channelContent.shorts.slice(0,6).forEach(v=>{%><a class="channel-short-card" href="/shorts?channel=<%=encodeURIComponent(entity.id)%>#<%=v.id%>"><img src="<%=v.thumbnail%>" alt="" loading="lazy"><b><%=v.title%></b><span><%=v.views||''%></span></a><%})%></div></section><%}%>
  <%}else{%>
    <section class="channel-section channel-listing"><div class="channel-section-head"><h2><%=entity.tab==='videos'?'動画':entity.tab==='shorts'?'ショート':entity.tab==='live'?'ライブ':entity.tab==='playlists'?'再生リスト':entity.tab==='community'?'コミュニティ':'チャンネル'%></h2><span><%=videos.length%>件</span></div>
      <%if(entity.tab==='community'){%>
        <%if(videos.length){%><div class="channel-community-feed"><%videos.forEach(v=>{%><article class="community-post"><header><a href="<%=v.authorId?'/channel/'+encodeURIComponent(v.authorId):'#'%>" class="community-author"><%if(v.authorThumbnail){%><img src="<%=v.authorThumbnail%>" alt=""><%}else{%><span class="fallback"><%=v.author?.slice(0,1)||'C'%></span><%}%><span><b><%=v.author||entity.title%></b><small><%=v.published||''%></small></span></a></header><div class="community-body"><p><%=v.content||''%></p><%if(v.thumbnail){%><img class="community-attachment" src="<%=v.thumbnail%>" alt="" loading="lazy"><%}%></div><footer><span>♡ <%=v.views||''%></span><span>💬 <%=v.replies||''%></span></footer></article><%})%></div><%}else{%><div class="channel-empty"><h2>コミュニティ投稿がありません</h2><p>このチャンネルには現在表示できる投稿がありません。</p></div><%}%>
      <%}else if(videos.length){%><div class="video-grid channel-video-grid"><%videos.forEach(v=>{%><article class="video-card"><a class="thumb" href="<%=v.isPlaylist?'/playlist?list='+encodeURIComponent(v.id):v.isShort?'/shorts?channel='+encodeURIComponent(entity.id)+'#'+v.id:'/watch?v='+v.id%>"><img src="<%=v.thumbnail%>" alt="" loading="lazy"><%if(v.duration){%><span class="duration"><%=v.duration%></span><%}%></a><div class="card-info"><%if(entity.image){%><img class="channel-avatar" src="<%=entity.image%>" alt=""><%}else{%><span class="channel-avatar fallback"><%=entity.title.slice(0,1)%></span><%}%><div class="card-copy"><a class="video-title" href="<%=v.isPlaylist?'/playlist?list='+encodeURIComponent(v.id):v.isShort?'/shorts?channel='+encodeURIComponent(entity.id)+'#'+v.id:'/watch?v='+v.id%>"><%=v.title%></a><span><%=v.views||v.count||''%></span><span><%=v.published||''%></span></div><button class="more-btn"><%-icon('more')%></button></div></article><%})%></div><%}else{%><div class="channel-empty"><h2>コンテンツがありません</h2><p>このタブには現在表示できるコンテンツがありません。</p></div><%}%>
    </section>
  <%}%>
</section>
<%}%>
<%if(page==='library'){const libraryMeta={subscriptions:{description:'登録しているチャンネル',icon:'sub'},history:{description:'視聴した動画',icon:'history'},watchLater:{description:'後で見るに保存した動画',icon:'clock'},likedVideos:{description:'高く評価した動画',icon:'like'}}[libraryType]||{description:'保存したコンテンツ',icon:'clock'};%><section class="library-page yt-library" data-library="<%=libraryType%>"><header class="yt-library-header"><div class="yt-library-icon"><%-icon(libraryMeta.icon)%></div><div><h1><%=title%></h1><p><%=libraryMeta.description%></p></div><div class="yt-library-actions"><button id="refreshLibrary" class="yt-icon-button" title="更新" aria-label="更新"><%-icon('history')%></button><button id="clearLibrary" class="yt-text-button">すべて削除</button></div></header><div class="yt-library-controls"><div class="yt-filter-chips"><button class="active" data-library-filter="all">すべて</button><button data-library-filter="recent">最近追加</button></div><div class="yt-library-tools"><label class="yt-library-search"><%-icon('search')%><input id="librarySearch" type="search" placeholder="検索" aria-label="このライブラリを検索"></label><select id="librarySort" aria-label="並び順"><option value="default">標準</option><option value="title">タイトル順</option></select><span id="libraryCount" class="yt-library-count"></span></div></div><div id="libraryStatus" class="yt-library-status"><span class="yt-loading-ring"></span><span>読み込み中...</span></div><section id="libraryGrid" class="video-grid yt-library-grid"></section></section><%}%>
<%if(page==='error'){%><div class="empty"><h1>うまく読み込めませんでした</h1><p><%=error%></p><a href="/" class="pill">ホームへ戻る</a></div><%}%></main><nav class="bottom-nav"><a href="/" class="bottom-item"><%-icon("home")%><span>ホーム</span></a><a href="/shorts" class="bottom-item"><%-icon("shorts")%><span>ショート</span></a><a href="/subscriptions" class="bottom-item"><%-icon("sub")%><span>登録チャンネル</span></a><a href="/history" id="mobileHistory" class="bottom-item"><%-icon("history")%><span>履歴</span></a></nav><div id="streamInfoDialog" class="modal-panel stream-info-dialog" hidden><div><button class="modal-close" aria-label="閉じる">×</button><h2>ストリーム情報</h2><p class="stream-info-note">利用可能な画質・音声形式を表示します。コンテンツの保存は、権利者が許可している公式手段を利用してください。</p><div id="streamInfoList" class="stream-info-list"><p class="muted">読み込み前</p></div></div></div><div id="authDialog" class="modal-panel auth-dialog" hidden><div><button class="modal-close" aria-label="閉じる">×</button><div id="authSignedOut"><h2>YouTubeアカウント</h2><p>テレビ認証を使ってログインすると、YouTubeアカウントのホームフィードをおすすめとして表示します。</p><button id="startAuthButton" class="auth-primary">テレビ認証を開始</button><p class="auth-warning">このブラウザー専用のログインです。別のブラウザー・端末では別のYouTubeアカウントでログインできます。</p></div><div id="authPending" hidden><h2>別の端末で認証</h2><p>次のページを開き、表示されたコードを入力してください。</p><a id="authVerificationLink" class="auth-link" href="https://www.youtube.com/activate" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">認証ページを開く</a><button id="copyAuthCode" class="auth-code" type="button"></button><p id="authCountdown" class="auth-muted">認証を待っています…</p></div><div id="authSignedIn" hidden><h2>ログイン済み</h2><div class="auth-account"><span id="authAccountAvatar" class="account-avatar">✓</span><div><b id="authAccountName">YouTubeアカウント</b><small id="authAccountHandle"></small></div></div><p>YouTubeアカウントのホームフィードをおすすめに使用しています。</p><button id="signOutButton" class="auth-danger">ログアウト</button></div><div id="authError" hidden><h2>認証エラー</h2><p id="authErrorMessage"></p><button id="retryAuthButton" class="auth-primary">再試行</button></div></div></div><aside id="queuePanel" class="queue-panel" aria-hidden="true"><div class="queue-head"><h2>キュー</h2><button id="closeQueue" aria-label="閉じる">×</button></div><div id="queueList"></div><div class="queue-actions"><button id="clearQueue">キューを消去</button></div></aside><div id="shortcutsDialog" class="modal-panel" hidden><div><button class="modal-close" aria-label="閉じる">×</button><h2>キーボード ショートカット</h2><p><kbd>/</kbd> 検索欄へ移動</p><p><kbd>t</kbd> シアターモード</p><p><kbd>m</kbd> ミュート</p><p><kbd>Esc</kbd> パネルを閉じる</p></div></div><div id="toast" class="toast" role="status"></div><script src="/app.js" defer></script></body></html>
